    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and your team have booked a cozy hotel for the night, but something feels off...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As soon as you step into the elevator, you notice it malfunctioning. Is this hotel really <u>safe</u>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore and collect items to navigate the Hotel of Horror and Abyss. Work with your team, communicate, help each other, and most importantly\u2014<u>stay alive</u>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every word matters with <strong>proximity voice chat</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is to escape the current floor while avoiding certain <strong>entities</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay alert to your surroundings... even those you trust.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a <strong>roguelike</strong> game where you collect coins to purchase cosmetics and other upgrades.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer Support &lt;3</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character customization included.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full Proximity Voice Chat</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full Procedural Levels</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Leaderboard System</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Inventory System</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stats</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548760/extras/cdfbe87974c3c6de6acb7dec09851c64.poster.avif?t=1752179446\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548760/extras/cdfbe87974c3c6de6acb7dec09851c64.webm?t=1752179446\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548760/extras/cdfbe87974c3c6de6acb7dec09851c64.mp4?t=1752179446\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>For now up to 4 players</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548760/extras/f86df957136c63fcc9405556e9563677.poster.avif?t=1752179446\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548760/extras/f86df957136c63fcc9405556e9563677.webm?t=1752179446\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548760/extras/f86df957136c63fcc9405556e9563677.mp4?t=1752179446\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect coins to unlock cosmetics!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customization Types:</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hats</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >backpacks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buttmarks / Text </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Faces</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548760/extras/24c1ac90a71fc5ad31e27127ebc8a058.poster.avif?t=1752179446\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548760/extras/24c1ac90a71fc5ad31e27127ebc8a058.webm?t=1752179446\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548760/extras/24c1ac90a71fc5ad31e27127ebc8a058.mp4?t=1752179446\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just make sure you <strong>don't fall down</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>",
